<main class="page">
  <h1 id="platform-title">Platform &amp; machine surfaces</h1>
  <p class="lead">The request scope, config, and observability primitives — plus lifecycle hooks, the machine surfaces every RPC is automatically exposed through, and the CLI / build tooling. Each sub-page drives one primitive as a live, interactive demo.</p>
  <Panel id="pages-in-this-section" title="Pages in this section">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="/platform/identity">Identity</a>
      <a href="/platform/scope">Scope</a>
